---
title: "setLegionAddress (LegionAddressRegistry)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: setLegionAddress(identifier, addr)
    q_check_auth --> q_check_params: caller is authorized (owner/admin)
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_params --> q_set_address: addr != address(0)
    q_check_params --> q_revert_params: invalid address
    q_set_address --> q_emit: registry[identifier] = addr
    q_emit --> [*]: emit LegionAddressSet(identifier, addr)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert UnauthorizedAccess
    q_revert_params --> [*]: revert InvalidAddress

    note right of q_set_address
        INV-001: registry maps unique identifiers to addresses
        INV-002: used by syncLegionAddresses in all sale contracts
        INV-003: centralized registry for Legion operator, fee recipient, signer addresses
    end note
